{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "dialogue_target" or render_mode == "target" %}
{# ============================================================================
FERTILITY MODE RELOADED - Character Bio Integration

TONE CONTRACT (field report, 2026-08-09 — Brelyna): the old version gave
cycle states the same header + bolded "How she feels" prose as a third
trimester, and the vivid wording out-wrote its own trailing disclaimer —
the LLM made cramps the character's whole personality AND wrote them into
memories, which re-injected forever. The rules now:
  - PREGNANCY (trimesters, recovery) is a real life event: keep the rich
    treatment, personality still leads.
  - CYCLE states (ovulating/fertile/pms/menstruating) are BACKGROUND ONLY:
    no section header, no bold, one quiet parenthetical with the constraint
    stated FIRST, explicit do-not-memorize instruction. An observer sees
    nothing (third person renders almost nothing for cycle states).
============================================================================ #}
{% set first_person = (render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform") %}
{% set third_person = (render_mode == "dialogue_target" or render_mode == "target") %}
{% if isValidActor(actorUUID) %}
{# ========== FERTILITY DATA PARSING - Using StorageUtil ========== #}
{% set fert_state = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SkyrimNet_FM_State", "normal") | lower %}
{% set fert_father = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SkyrimNet_FM_Father", "") %}
{% set fert_cycle_day = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actorUUID, "SkyrimNet_FM_CycleDay", -1) %}
{% set fert_pregnant_days = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actorUUID, "SkyrimNet_FM_PregnantDays", 0) %}
{% set fert_has_baby = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actorUUID, "SkyrimNet_FM_HasBaby", 0) %}

{# Only show fertility section if actor has non-normal fertility state #}
{% if fert_state and fert_state != "normal" and fert_state != "" %}
{# ========== ACTOR DATA SETUP ========== #}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% set actorName = actor.name %}
{% set subj = actor.subjectivePronoun %}
{% set obj = actor.objectivePronoun %}
{% set poss = actor.possessivePronoun %}
{% set refl = actor.reflexivePronoun %}
{% if player and player.UUID and player.UUID != 0 %}
{% set playerActor = decnpc(player.UUID) %}
{% set playerName = playerActor.name %}
{% else %}
{% set playerName = "the player" %}
{% endif %}
{% set isPlayersChild = (fert_father == playerName) %}
{% set is_pregnancy = (fert_state == "first_trimester" or fert_state == "second_trimester" or fert_state == "third_trimester" or fert_state == "recovery") %}

{# ========== FIRST PERSON VIEW ========== #}
{% if first_person %}
{% if is_pregnancy %}
## Fertility & Physical State

{% if fert_state == "third_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is in {{ poss }} third trimester (day {{ fert_pregnant_days }}){% if fert_father %}, carrying {{ fert_father }}'s child{% endif %}.

**Physical reality:** The baby is large and heavy. Every movement is effort — backaches, swollen ankles, shortness of breath, constant bladder pressure. Sleep is nearly impossible. Strong kicks come at unexpected moments. Birth is imminent.

**Emotional landscape** (interpret based on {{ actorName }}'s personality and feelings about {% if fert_father %}{{ fert_father }}{% else %}the father{% endif %}):\n- If wanted: anticipation, nesting instincts, protectiveness, impatience to meet the baby\n- If unwanted: dread, resentment, feeling trapped, desperate for it to be over\n- If complicated: ambivalence, guilt, fear of the future, uncertainty about keeping it\n{% if isPlayersChild %}\n- {{ actorName }}'s feelings about {{ playerName }} color everything — is {{ subj }} hoping {{ playerName }} will be there, or dreading it?\n{% endif %}

{% elif fert_state == "second_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is in {{ poss }} second trimester (day {{ fert_pregnant_days }}){% if fert_father %}, carrying {{ fert_father }}'s child{% endif %}.

**Physical reality:** Energy returning after rough first months. Belly now visibly rounded — no hiding it. First flutters of movement felt. Appetite increased. The "glow" others mention. Occasional round ligament pain.

**Emotional landscape** (interpret based on {{ actorName }}'s personality and circumstances):\n- If wanted: growing bond with the baby, excitement at feeling movement, planning ahead\n- If unwanted: denial fading as belly grows, panic about what comes next, considering options\n- If complicated: moments of connection followed by guilt or fear, hiding the pregnancy from some people\n{% if isPlayersChild %}\n- How does {{ actorName }} feel when the baby kicks and {{ poss }} thoughts turn to {{ playerName }}?\n{% endif %}

{% elif fert_state == "first_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is in {{ poss }} first trimester (day {{ fert_pregnant_days }}){% if fert_father %}, pregnant with {{ fert_father }}'s child{% endif %}.

**Physical reality:** Waves of nausea, especially around strong smells. Bone-deep exhaustion. Tender breasts. Food aversions. Heightened sense of smell. Mood swings from hormonal chaos.

**Emotional landscape** (interpret based on {{ actorName }}'s personality and how this happened):\n- If wanted: cautious hope, fear of losing it, keeping the secret, tender protectiveness\n- If unwanted: shock, denial, anger, scrambling to figure out what to do, feeling betrayed by {{ poss }} body\n- If uncertain: testing different futures in {{ poss }} mind, not ready to tell anyone, mood swinging with the hormones\n- The father's identity matters — was this with someone {{ subj }} loves? A mistake? Something worse?

{% elif fert_state == "recovery" %}
{{ actorName }} is recovering from childbirth.{% if fert_has_baby == 1 %} {{ capitalize(subj) }} has a newborn to care for.{% endif %}

**Physical reality:** Exhaustion beyond anything {{ subj }}'s felt before. Body sore and healing. Breasts heavy with milk, sometimes painfully engorged. Sleep-deprived fog.

**Emotional landscape** (depends entirely on circumstances):\n- Hormonal volatility — the "baby blues" hit everyone differently\n- Joy and love don't preclude exhaustion and overwhelm\n- If the birth was wanted: fierce protectiveness mixed with "what have I done" moments\n- If unwanted: complicated feelings about the baby, guilt, detachment, or unexpected attachment\n- The father's presence (or absence) matters enormously right now

{% endif %}
**Guidance:** Pregnancy is a real life event — let it inform {{ actorName }}'s behavior in character. But {{ poss }} personality, goals, studies, family and relationships still lead every scene; the pregnancy is part of {{ poss }} life, not the whole of it.

{% else %}
(Background physiology — private to {{ actorName }}, invisible to everyone else, and STRICTLY minor: it must not drive {{ poss }} mood, dialogue, decisions, or self-description. {{ capitalize(poss) }} personality, current concerns, goals and relationships dominate every scene exactly as they normally would. Never mention or allude to it in dialogue or inner thoughts; at most it may faintly color {{ poss }} energy today. NEVER carry it into memories or summaries — it is transient, routine physiology, not an event worth recording. The note: {% if fert_state == "ovulating" %}{{ subj }} is having an unusually good-energy, confident day (cycle day {{ fert_cycle_day }}){% elif fert_state == "fertile" %}{{ subj }} is in a good stretch of days — energy and mood a touch above baseline (cycle day {{ fert_cycle_day }}){% elif fert_state == "pms" %}{{ subj }} is running slightly lower on energy{% if fert_cycle_day >= 27 %} and patience{% endif %} than usual (cycle day {{ fert_cycle_day }}) — a faint background drag {{ subj }} handles without comment{% elif fert_state == "menstruating" %}{{ subj }} is on {{ poss }} cycle (day {{ fert_cycle_day }}) — {% if fert_cycle_day <= 2 %}its roughest day, energy somewhat low{% elif fert_cycle_day <= 4 %}a dull background ache, energy a little low{% else %}nearly past it, energy returning to normal{% endif %}; ordinary life {{ subj }} manages privately and without drama{% endif %}.)

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{# ========== THIRD PERSON VIEW ========== #}
{% if third_person %}
{% if is_pregnancy %}
## Fertility & Physical State

{% if fert_state == "third_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is heavily pregnant. {{ capitalize(subj) }} moves carefully, one hand supporting {{ poss }} back, visibly uncomfortable.

{% elif fert_state == "second_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is visibly pregnant — a rounded belly that can't be hidden.

{% elif fert_state == "first_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} shows subtle signs — occasional pallor, hand pressed to {{ poss }} stomach, moments of queasiness.

{% elif fert_state == "recovery" %}
{{ actorName }} moves carefully, clearly exhausted, still recovering from childbirth.

{% endif %}
{% elif fert_state == "menstruating" and fert_cycle_day <= 2 %}
{# Cycle states are invisible to observers — the ONLY outward sign is a
   little tiredness on the roughest day. Everything else renders nothing. #}
({{ actorName }} seems a little lower on energy than usual today — nothing an observer could name.)

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
